cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite AssembleNIST together with AlphaNIST
  and Success Guided Sampling. See CITATION.bib for the related papers.
type: software
title: "AssembleNIST: One Policy for All NIST Board Assemblies in MuJoCo"
authors:
  - family-names: Sun
    given-names: Tao
    affiliation: Stanford University
    website: https://taosun.io
repository-code: https://github.com/suniique/assembly-nist
url: https://github.com/suniique/assembly-nist
abstract: >-
  An independent MuJoCo implementation of the AlphaNIST approach to robotic
  assembly. A single reinforcement-learning policy controls a Franka Panda
  arm for all 20 tasks on the NIST Assembly Task Board 1. The repository
  includes PyTorch PPO training, Success Guided Sampling, pretrained
  policies, simulation assets, evaluation, and visualization tools.
keywords:
  - robotic assembly
  - reinforcement learning
  - MuJoCo
  - NIST Assembly Task Board
  - Franka Panda
  - AlphaNIST
  - Proximal Policy Optimization
  - Success Guided Sampling
  - PyTorch
license: MIT
